# =============================================================================
# Review-scraper API keys
# =============================================================================

# Yelp scraping uses a 3-layer fallback (configured in review/sites/yelp.py):
#
#   LAYER 1 — Yelp Academic Open Dataset (offline, free, no key needed)
#     Download once: 21MB business + 2.86GB review JSON from archive.org
#     and the loader streams them on first run. See
#     review/yelp_dataset_loader.py + review/yelp_dataset/.
#     Coverage: ~160K businesses, ~7M reviews from MA/OR/TX/FL/GA/BC/OH/CO/WA.
#     Hit rate on a nationwide HVAC list: ~0.5%, but matches return up to
#     100 real reviews per business.
#
#   LAYER 2 — Yelp Fusion API (online, free 5000 calls/day, needs key below)
#     Yelp's edge layer (DataDome) blocks every datacenter / shared-proxy IP
#     with a 403 — verified across UC mode, CDP mode, curl_cffi with 5 browser
#     fingerprints, direct connection, and api/mobile/robots subdomains. The
#     official Fusion API is the only working live path.
#     Sign up: https://www.yelp.com/developers/v3/manage_app  (instant approval)
YELP_API_KEY=
